  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Arrangement of an office for learning the Slovak language: the educational process is comfortable for the child</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Arrangement of an office for learning the Slovak language: the educational process is comfortable for the child</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Projekt je zameran&#xFD; na zlep&#x161;enie vyu&#x10D;ovacieho procesu prostredn&#xED;ctvom vybavenia u&#x10D;ebne na l&#xFD;ceu v obci Nizhne Selyshche. Z projektu bude zak&#xFA;pen&#xFD; nov&#xFD; n&#xE1;bytok, modern&#xE9; technick&#xE9; zariadenia (projektor, notebooky, interakt&#xED;vna tabu&#x13E;a a i.) s pr&#xED;slu&#x161;enstvom a &#x10F;al&#x161;ie vzdel&#xE1;vacie pom&#xF4;cky.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve the teaching process by equipping a classroom at the lyceum in the village of Nizhne Selyshche. From the project, new furniture will be purchased, along with modern technical equipment (projector, laptops, interactive whiteboard, etc.) along with their accessories and other educational aids.</narrative>
  </description>
